n":["8cc6af97-3401-40df-9d2e-304dbb8eeba2"]},"8cc6af97-3401-40df-9d2e-304dbb8eeba2":{"id":"8cc6af97-3401-40df-9d2e-304dbb8eeba2","message":{"id":"8cc6af97-3401-40df-9d2e-304dbb8eeba2","author":{"role":"user","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1742579487.211,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"text","parts":["002E83\nElectric coolant pump, energy operation"]},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":null,"weight":1,"metadata":{"serialization_metadata":{"custom_symbol_offsets":[]},"request_id":"923f4c20085b1cde-ORD","message_source":null,"timestamp_":"absolute","message_type":null},"recipient":"all","channel":null},"parent":"7e354e7b-f1cb-4019-8492-75f25684b6bb","children":["51040db2-8387-491d-948f-d5ea764dfb97"]},"51040db2-8387-491d-948f-d5ea764dfb97":{"id":"51040db2-8387-491d-948f-d5ea764dfb97","message":{"id":"51040db2-8387-491d-948f-d5ea764dfb97","author":{"role":"tool","name":"myfiles_browser","metadata":{}},"create_time":1742579499.257926,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"tether_browsing_display","result":"","summary":"","assets":null,"tether_id":null},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":null,"weight":0,"metadata":{"command":"spinner","status":"running","message_type":null,"model_slug":"gpt-4o","default_model_slug":"o3-mini","parent_id":"8cc6af97-3401-40df-9d2e-304dbb8eeba2","request_id":"923f4c20085b1cde-ORD","timestamp_":"absolute"},"recipient":"all","channel":null},"parent":"8cc6af97-3401-40df-9d2e-304dbb8eeba2","children":["1b48f1f8-1bcd-4a2f-9e03-06e0327380e1"]},"1b48f1f8-1bcd-4a2f-9e03-06e0327380e1":{"id":"1b48f1f8-1bcd-4a2f-9e03-06e0327380e1","message":{"id":"1b48f1f8-1bcd-4a2f-9e03-06e0327380e1","author":{"role":"tool","name":"myfiles_browser","metadata":{}},"create_time":1742579499.258093,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"tether_quote","url":"file-C9MzJgQeNVVzsLHXudohD3","domain":"E90 Code List.pdf","text":"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nE90 Code List.numbers\n\n\nTable 1\n. Function title Module Function value 2006 2007 2008 2009 2010 2011 Description\n. Seat Belt Chime ABG SBR_BEIFAHRER_2_CD X X X Disables seat belt chime for passenger side (CIC)\n. Seat Belt Chime ABG SBR_BEIFAHRER_1 X X X Disables seat belt chime for passenger side\n. Seat Belt Chime ABG SBR_FAHRER_1 X X X X X Disables seat belt chime for driver side\n\n. Lock/unlock beep option in iDrive (part 1)\nCAPPL \n(CCC) ACOUSTIC: aktiv X X X X\n\nAdds a submenu for lock/unlock beep in iDrive Settings (must have alarm \ninstalled)\n\n. Auto Light Sensitivity Control in Idrive (Multiple \nChanges required, see Description)\n\nCAPPL \n(CCC) RAIN_LIGHT_SENSOR X X\n\nAllows you to control the auto light/rain sensor in idrive- Change: \nRAIN_LIGHT_SENSOR to aktiv and then YOU MUST MODIFY THE FOLLOWING \n3 lines: C750A_SCHWELLWERT_EMPFIN, C750A_SCHWELLWERT_NORMAL, \nand C750A_SCHWELLWERT_SEHR_E from par_gesperrt to par_frei\n\n. Disable iDrive Disclaimer\nCAPPL \n(CCC) LEGAL_DISCL X X X\n\nDisables iDrive legal disclaimer during iDrive startup. This is for the earlier E90 \nwith CCC module.\n\n. DRL option in iDrive\nCAPPL \n(CCC) DAY_RUN_LIGHT_CCC X X X\n\nAdds a submenu with DRL option (On,Off) in iDrive settings. Change \"nicht_aktiv\" \nto \"aktiv\"\n\n.\nEnable TV / Video viewing whilst Driving\n\nCAPPL \n(CCC) VIDEO_DENY_C0B X X\n\nPrevents blocking picture message to appear in iDrive and enables you to watch \nTV/Video whilst driving. (TV module is an option in some countries) Change from \n\"deny_stop_break\" to \"deny_never\"\n\n. iDrive Default Screen Communication\nCAPPL \n(CCC) VA_FB_COMMUNICATION X\n\niDrive screen switches to Communication few seconds after startup (assumed--\nonly tested VA_FB_ENTERTAINMENT).\n\n. iDrive Default Screen Entertainment\nCAPPL \n(CCC) VA_FB_ENTERTAINMENT X\n\niDrive screen switches to Entertainment a few seconds after startup.\n\n. iDrive Default Screen Navigation\nCAPPL \n(CCC) VA_FB_NAVIGATION X\n\niDrive screen switches to Navigation a few seconds after startup (assumed--only \ntested VA_FB_ENTERTAINMENT).\n\n. Lock/unlock beep option in iDrive (part 2)\nCAPPL \n(CCC) C941C_QUITT_AKUST_KLAPPE: fkt_frei X X X\n\nAdds a submenu for lock/unlock beep in iDrive Settings (must have alarm \ninstalled)\n\n. Lock/unlock beep option in iDrive (part 3)\nCAPPL \n(CCC) K9416_QUITT_AKUST_ENTSCH: fkt_frei X X X\n\n. Lock/unlock beep option in iDrive (part 4)\nCAPPL \n(CCC) C9413_QUITT_AKUST_SCHAERF: fkt_frei X X X\n\n. Close Windows/Roof with CA CAS KOMFORTSCHLIESSUNG_PA X X X X Closes windows + moon roof through comfort access\n\n. Close Windows/Roof with Fob CAS KOMFORTSCHLIESSUNG_FB X X X X X X Closes windows + moon roof through Key Fob\n\n. Panic Mode CAS SONDERTASTE_PANIKALARM X X X X\nEnables panic alarm. Must have alarm installed. Hold trunk botton on FOB for 5 \nsecs to activate. Change from \"nicht_aktiv\" to \"panikalarm\"\n\n.\n\nUnlock Doors CAS ER_KEYOUT_AUTOVR X X X X X X\n\nUnlocks all doors when you remove key (2009: Only unlocks driver door if FOB set \nto unlock driver door only. Set FOB to unlock all doors, and this will unlock all \ndoors, too) (also works with Comfort Access when engine is shut off, might need \nKOMFORT_EJECT activated) **Automatic door lock when you drive off must be \nenabled and must be the reason the doors locked for this feature to work, i.e. if \nyou press the Central Lock button before the drive-off lock kicks in, the doors will \nnot auto-unlock.\n\n. Auto Dimming Mirrors CAS SPIEGEL_ELEKTROCHROM X X nicht_aktiv to turn off autodim mirror\n\n. Engine Start CAS ANLASSSPERRE_BLSRE_BLS X Start engine without pressing the brake (Does not work on 2010) - spazticrecords\n\n.\nKey Fob Ejected from Socket upon Engine Stop CAS KOMFORT_EJECT X X X X X\n\nWhen turning the engine off key fob will be ejected from socket. (Need to hold \nstart/stop for extra 2 seconds) -- Does this prevent the door from chiming if you \nleave the key in the slot?\n\n. Weather Radio Band CIC RADIO_WEATHERBAND X X Adds NOAA Weather Radio band. Change to \"aktiv\"\n\n.\nAudio System CIC REST_TASTE_VERBAUT X X X\n\nSelects CIC audio outputs from Stereo (High Level, front full range, rear high pass \nanalog signals, 25W max); HiFi (low level, 5V, front and rear full range, Balanced \nanalog signals); and Top_HiFi (MOST fiber optics, proprietary digital signals).\n\n.\nDisable iDrive Disclaimer CIC LEGAL_DISCLAIMER_TIME X X X\n\nDisables iDrive legal disclaimer during iDrive startup. Change the value: \nld_mit_timeout --> kein_ld (NOTE: That's a lowercase \"L\", not a capital \"I\" or the \nnumber \"1\".\n\n. DRL option in iDrive CIC DAYDRIVING_LIGHT X\nAdds a submenu with DRL option (On,Off) in iDrive settings. Change \"perm_off\" to \n\"standard\" (On 2010+ this is already set to standard\")\n\n. DVD Playback CIC VIDEO_NUR_MIT_HANDBREMSE X X X\nEnables DVD playback when car is stopped regardless of what gear but not in \nmotion. *Remove DVD from drive before coding\n\n.\nFuel Stop Suggestion in Route Guidance CIC NAVI_FUELSTOP_PROPOSAL X X X\n\nGo to \"Route Information\" on iDrive when you're going somewhere and it will tell \nyou at what point(s) along your journey you'll likely need to fill up. You can then \nselect that notice and it will tell you about the stations in the area at that point on \nyour trip.\n\n. Disable DSC completely in MDRIVE menu CIC DSC_OFF_CIC X If set to aktiv, will re-enable the ability to completely disable DSC in mdrive menu.\n\n. DVD-In Motion CIC\nComplicated, but accomplished by bmwcoding.com. Requires advanced coding \nexperience to understand the concept.\n\n. iDrive Display Modes CIC NAVI_MAPMODE_AUTOMATIC X\nAdds a submenu with 3 options under Day Mode (day, night, auto) (***DOES NOT \nWORK ON E90 2010/11 or E92 2009/10)\n\n. Alarm beep on unlock DWAI QUIT_AKUST_ENTSCH X X X Alarm beep on unlock (two beeps) (must have alarm installed)\n\n. Alarm beep on lock DWAI QUIT_AKUST_SCHAERF X X X X Alarm beep on lock (one beep) (must have alarm installed)\n\n. Sound alarm chirp level DWAS BUZZER_HIGH_LEVEL X X X Alarm chirp sound .Replace wert_06, wert_07, wert_08 by wert_04, wert_05\n\n. Fog Lights + Flash\nFRM \n(NFRM) LH_UND_NSW_NICHT_GLEICHZ X X X X\n\nAllows fog lights to stay on when the high beams are flashed. Change to \nnicht_aktiv\n\n. Fog Lights + High Beam\nFRM                 \n(NFRM) FL_UND_NSW_NICHT_GLEICHZ X X X X\n\nAllows fog lights to stay on when the high beams are on. Change to nicht_aktiv\n\n. Bulb Testing Warning\nFRM \n(NFRM) WARMUEBERWACHUNG_KZL X\n\nWarm testing bulbs in number plate light bulb - change setting to nicht_aktiv\n\n. Enable DRL on Halogen\nFRM \n(NFRM) TAGFAHRLICHT_ECE_0 X\n\nThat's what my ODB set to aktiv when i activate DRL from the Cluster. Need to \nactivate that for front parking lights as DRL with Halogens Lamps.\n\n. Bulb Testing Warning\nFRM \n(NFRM) KALTUE_FRA_V_M1_13_M2_40 X\n\nCold testing bulbs in turn signal front - change setting to nicht_aktiv\n\n. Auto Dimming Mirrors\nFRM \n(NFRM) SPIEGEL_ELEKTROCHROM X\n\nnicht_aktiv to turn off autodim mirror or aktiv to enable mirror\n\n.\nCorner Delete Mod\n\nFRM \n(NFRM) SIDEMARKER_US (see Note) X X X X X\n\nDisables side marker/signal light when headlights are on. Change the value to \n\"nicht_aktiv\". Module value might be longer than SIDEMARKER_US. Here are \nsome examples: SIDEMARKER_US_NFRM, SIDEMARKER_US_NF, or \nSIDEMARKER_US_MIT_FRA_V.\n\nCorner Delete Mod on welcome \nFRM \n(NFRM) WL_FRA_V\n\nDisables Side marker lights from welcome lighting. Change to nicht_aktiv\n\n. Corner LED Delete Mod\nFRM \n(NFRM) PO_RL_FKT_MIT_SL_V X X X\n\nDisables side marker/signal light when headlights are on.\n\n. Corner LED Delete Mod\nFRM \n(NFRM) PWM_SL_V X X\n\nDisables corner LED light; 2008,9 E92 - Value is wert_04. Applies to parking lights \n(when u turn lights one click to the right from off position)\n\n. Corner LED Delete Mod E92\nFRM \n(NFRM) PWM_SL_V_BEI_AKTIVEN_AL X X\n\nDisables corner LED light; 2008 E92 - Value is \"wert_04\" (low beams only?)\n\n. Corner LED Delete Mod E92\nFRM \n(NFRM) PWM_SL_V_BEI_AKTIVEN_FL X X\n\nDisables corner LED light; 2008 E92 - Value is \"wert_04\" (high beams only?)\n\n.\nDisable windows safety feature\n\nFRM \n(NFRM) TUERAUF_STOP_MAUT X X X X\n\nOpening doors will not interrupt window roll up operation. Normally, if you open a \ndoor while the window is automatically rolling up, it will stop the operation. This \nfeature disables it.\n\n. Double Blink Hazards when button is pressed\nFRM \n(NFRM) DOPPELBLINKIMPULS_WARNBLK X X X X\n\nHazard lights will double blink instead of single blink. (couldn't find value in 06 \nmodel but theres BLINKIMPULS_WARNBLK set to wert 1)\n\n.\nDRL High Beam\n\nFRM \n(NFRM) TAGFAHRLICHT_ECE_1 X\n\nDisables the Daytime Running Lights (High Beam) Canadian models. * At this \npoint I have not yet been able to turn on the AE's as DRL's * --> check \nVERHALTEN_DRL_TFL below\n\n. mirrors w/ FOB\nFRM \n(NFRM) SPIEGEL_KOMFORT_EINKLAPP X X X X\n\nFold side mirrors with FOB (CA also works 2009/01 E92). Mirrors folded with the \nbutton inside the car cannot be unfolded via the FOB.\n\n. Front corner LED lights on when unlocking the \ncar\n\nFRM \n(NFRM) WL_POL_3R X X X\n\nFront corner LED light on when Welcome Light activated. Values: \n\"hart_einschalten\" - instant on; \"soft_einschalten\" - gradual; \"nicht_aktiv\" - \ndisabled.\n\n. Front fog lights on when unlocking the car\nFRM \n(NFRM) WL_NSW X X X\n\nFront fog lights on when Welcome Light activated. Values: \"hart_einschalten\" - \ninstant on; \"soft_einschalten\" - gradual; \"nicht_aktiv\" - disabled.\n\n. Low beams on when unlocking the car\nFRM \n(NFRM) WL_AL X X\n\nLow beams turn on when Welcome Light activated. Values: \"hart_einschalten\" - \ninstant on; \"soft_einschalten\" - gradual (ONLY NON-HIDs); \"nicht_aktiv\" - disabled.\n\n. Rear fog lights on when unlocking the car\nFRM \n(NFRM) WL_NSL X X X\n\nRear fog lights on when Welcome Light activated. Values: \"hart_einschalten\" - \ninstant on; \"soft_einschalten\" - gradual; \"nicht_aktiv\" - disabled.\n\n.\nRear license plate on when unlocking the car\n\nFRM \n(NFRM) WL_KZL (or WL_KZL_3R) X X X\n\nRear license plate lights on when Welcome Light activated. Values: \n\"hart_einschalten\" - instant on; \"soft_einschalten\" - gradual; \"nicht_aktiv\" - \ndisabled.\n\n. Adaptive Headlight Error\nFRM \n(NFRM) CHECK_SMC_ERROR\n\nRemoves the adaptive headlight error check\n\n. All High Beams\nFRM \n(NFRM) PWM_FL_BEI_BIXENON\n\nChange \"wert_02\" to \"wert_01\" to have both the bixenons and the halogen as high \nbeams\n\n. Angel Eyes Error: need to code all the following\nFRM \n(NFRM) FEHLERMELDUNG_CC_SL_V_L X\n\n. Angel Eyes Error: need to code all the following\nFRM \n(NFRM) FEHLERMELDUNG_CC_SL_V_R X\n\n. Angel Eyes Error: need to code all the following\nFRM \n(NFRM) KALTUEBERWACHUNG_SL_V_L X\n\nRemoves/disables angel eye / parking light errors\n\n. Angel Eyes Error: need to code all the following\nFRM \n(NFRM) KALTUEBERWACHUNG_SL_V_R X\n\n. Angel Eyes Error: need to code all the following\nFRM \n(NFRM) WARMUEBERWACHUNG_SL_V_L X\n\n. Angel Eyes Error: need to code all the following\nFRM \n(NFRM) WARMUEBERWACHUNG_SL_V_R X\n\n.\nAngel Eyes on when unlocking the car\n\nFRM \n(NFRM) WL_SL_1 X\n\nAngel Eyes on when Welcome Light activated. Tested only on e92. Values: \n\"hart_einschalten\" - instant on; \"soft_einschalten\" - gradual; \"nicht_aktiv\" - \ndisabled.\n\n. BFD with Regular Brake Light\nFRM \n(NFRM) BREMSL_FKT_MIT_BFD X\n\nNow you will have both brake lights glowing ( Standard Brakelight with Brake \nForce Light )\n\n. Bulb Testing Warning\nFRM \n(NFRM) KALTUEBERWACHUNG_AL\n\nCold testing bulbs in low beam - change setting to nicht_aktiv\n\n. Bulb Testing Warning\nFRM \n(NFRM) KALTUEBERWACHUNG_BLK_HI X\n\nCold testing bulbs in turn signal rear - change setting to nicht_aktiv\n\n. Bulb Testing Warning\nFRM \n(NFRM) KALTUEBERWACHUNG_BLK_VO X X\n\nCold testing bulbs in turn signal - change setting to nicht_aktiv\n\n. Bulb Testing Warning\nFRM \n(NFRM) KALTUEBERWACHUNG_FL\n\nCold testing bulbs in high beam - change setting to nicht_aktiv\n\n. Bulb Testing Warning\nFRM \n(NFRM) KALTUEBERWACHUNG_KZL X X\n\nCold testing bulbs in number plate - change setting to Nnicht_aktiv\n\n. Bulb Testing Warning\nFRM \n(NFRM) KALTUEBERWACHUNG_KZL_LI\n\n. Bulb Testing Warning\nFRM \n(NFRM) KALTUEBERWACHUNG_NSW X\n\nCold testing bulbs in foglights - change setting to nicht_aktiv\n\n. Bulb Testing Warning\nFRM \n(NFRM) KALTUEBERWACHUNG_RL X\n\nCold testing bulbs in reversing light - change setting to nicht_aktiv\n\n. Bulb Testing Warning\nFRM \n(NFRM) WARMUEBERWACHUNG_AL\n\nWarm testing bulbs in low beams - change setting to nicht_aktiv\n\n. Bulb Testing Warning\nFRM \n(NFRM) WARMUEBERWACHUNG_AL_L\n\nWarm testing bulbs in low beams - change setting to nicht_aktiv\n\n. Bulb Testing Warning\nFRM \n(NFRM) WARMUEBERWACHUNG_BL_MI\n\nWarm testing bulbs in brakes - change setting to nicht_aktiv\n\n. Bulb Testing Warning\nFRM \n(NFRM) WARMUEBERWACHUNG_BLK_HI\n\nWarm testing bulbs in rear turn signals - change setting to nicht_aktiv\n\n. Bulb Testing Warning\nFRM \n(NFRM) WARMUEBERWACHUNG_BLK_VO\n\nWarm testing bulbs in front turn signals - change setting to nicht_aktiv\n\n. Bulb Testing Warning\nFRM \n(NFRM) WARMUEBERWACHUNG_FL\n\nWarm testing bulbs in\nThe file is too long and its contents have been truncated.\n","title":"E90 Code List.pdf","tether_id":null},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":null,"weight":1,"metadata":{"command":"context_stuff","is_visually_hidden_from_conversation":false,"message_type":null,"model_slug":"gpt-4o","default_model_slug":"o3-mini","parent_id":"51040db2-8387-491d-948f-d5ea764dfb97","request_id":"923f4c20085b1cde-ORD","timestamp_":"absolute"},"recipient":"all","channel":null},"parent":"51040db2-8387-491d-948f-d5ea764dfb97","children":["d02a166e-1fb9-42bf-9895-f3ce3a1b5136"]},"d02a166e-1fb9-42bf-9895-f3ce3a1b5136":{"id":"d02a166e-1fb9-42bf-9895-f3ce3a1b5136","message":{"id":"d02a166e-1fb9-42bf-9895-f3ce3a1b5136","author":{"role":"tool","name":"myfiles_browser","metadata":{}},"create_time":1742579499.258197,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"tether_quote","url":"file-RhbewvuTm9TXou3nvXrpWs","domain":"BMW E Series Coding.pdf","text":"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCategory Function Title Module Function Value From To Requires Description\nAlarm Alarm beep on lock DWAI QUIT_AKUST_SCHAERF nicht_aktiv aktiv Alarm Alarm beep on lock (one beep)\nAlarm Alarm beep on unlock DWAI QUIT_AKUST_ENTSCH nicht_aktiv aktiv Alarm Alarm beep on unlock (two beeps)\nAlarm Alarm chirp level DWAS BUZZER_HIGH_LEVEL See Description See Description Alarm Alarm chirp sound .Replace wert_06, wert_07, wert_08 by wert_04, wert_05\nAlarm Disable Keyhole Alarm CAS SCHAERFEN/ENTSCHAERFEN schloss_und_fernbedienung nur_mit_fernbedienung Alarm Set the key in the door to not disarm the alarm system, only remote will disarm alarm system.\nAlarm Enable Panic Mode CAS SONDERTASTE_PANIKALARM nicht_aktiv panikalarm Alarm Enables panic alarm.  Must have alarm installed.  Hold trunk botton on FOB for 5 secs to activate.\nAlerts Door gong when key in ignition KOMBI CC_ZUENDSCHLUESSEL aktiv nicht_aktiv Disables gong when car is off, driver's door is open and key is in slot.  May reset ECU and service counter/dates.\nAlerts Door gong when key in ignition KOMBI ZUENDSCHLUESSEL_WARNUNG aktiv nicht_aktiv Disables gong when car is off, driver's door is open and key is in slot.  May reset ECU and service counter/dates.\nAlerts Seat Belt Chime - Driver ABG SBR_FAHRER_1 aktiv nicht_aktiv Disables seat belt chime for driver side\nAlerts Seat Belt Chime - Driver ABG SBR_PREWARNING_FA_MRS aktiv nicht_aktiv Disables seat belt chime for driver side\nAlerts Seat Belt Chime - Passenger ABG SBR_BEIFAHRER_1 aktiv nicht_aktiv Disables seat belt chime for passenger side\nAlerts Seat Belt Chime - Passenger ABG SBR_BEIFAHRER_2_CD aktiv nicht_aktiv Disables seat belt chime for passenger side\nAlerts Seat Belt Chime - Passenger ABG SBR_PREWARNING_BF_MRS aktiv nicht_aktiv Disables seat belt chime for passenger side\nAlerts Seat Belt Reminder in iDrive ABG CC_GURTWARNUNG aktiv nicht_aktiv iDrive Disable Seat Belt Reminder in iDrive.  (Note: Some cars may need this to be disabled to get rid of the seat belt chime)\nAlerts Seat Belt Reminder in iDrive ABG CC_GURTWARNUNG_1 aktiv nicht_aktiv iDrive Disable Seat Belt Reminder in iDrive.  (Note: Some cars may need this to be disabled to get rid of the seat belt chime)\nAudio Change incoming call ring tone MULF2 RING_TONE wert_01 wert_02 Change the incoming ring tone of MULF2.  Ring tone like the standard \"gong\" but more quick.\nClimate Control Climate don't turn ON in Auto mode - Part 1 IHK KLIMA_MIT_AUTO_0 aktiv nicht_aktiv A/C will not automatically turn on when Auto is pressed.\nClimate Control Climate don't turn ON in Auto mode - Part 2 IHK KLIMA_MIT_AUTO_1 aktiv nicht_aktiv A/C will not automatically turn on when Auto is pressed.\nClimate Control Climate don't turn ON in Auto mode - Part 3 IHK KLIMA_MIT_AUTO_10/15 aktiv nicht_aktiv A/C will not automatically turn on when Auto is pressed.\nClimate Control Climate don't turn ON in Auto mode - Part 4 IHK KLIMA_MIT_AUTO_2 aktiv nicht_aktiv A/C will not automatically turn on when Auto is pressed.\nClimate Control Enable the parked car ventilation option 2RAD STANDHEIZUNG nicht_aktiv aktiv No iDrive Enables the parked car ventilation optio. Gives you 2 programmable timers to set when you would like the cabin fan to switch on.\nClimate Control REST feature enable on cars with an ALL button IHK REST_TASTE_VERBAUT nicht_aktiv aktiv Toggle between ALL and REST feature. The REST fully works as in the 2007-2010 cars.\nDoors/Windows/Mirrors Auto Unlock Doors on key eject CAS ER_KEYOUT_AUTOVR nicht_aktiv aktiv Unlocks all doors when you remove key (also works with Comfort Access when engine is shut off, might need KOMFORT_EJECT activated)\nDoors/Windows/Mirrors Close Windows/Roof with CA CAS KOMFORTSCHLIESSUNG_PA nicht_aktiv aktiv Comfort Access Closes windows + moon roof through comfort access\nDoors/Windows/Mirrors Close Windows/Roof with Fob CAS KOMFORTSCHLIESSUNG_FB nicht_aktiv aktiv Closes windows + moon roof through Key Fob\nDoors/Windows/Mirrors Disable Auto Dim Mirrors CAS SPIEGEL_ELEKTROCHROM aktiv nicht_aktiv Disables autodimming mirrors\nDoors/Windows/Mirrors Disable windows safety feature (N)FRM (FH_)TUERAUF_STOP_MAUT(_3R) aktiv nicht_aktiv Opening doors will not interrupt window roll up operation and auto roll-up works when door is open.\nDoors/Windows/Mirrors Door Locks - Central locking with key only (2)JBBF ENTSICHERN_CENTERLOCK aktiv nicht_aktiv Central Locking Button unlocks only with key in ignition.\nDoors/Windows/Mirrors Fold/unfold mirrors with fob - Part 1 (N)FRM ASP_KOMFORT_EINKLAPP aktiv nicht_aktiv Folds side mirrors with FOB and CA.  Requires that closing windows/moonroof with fob also be enabled (KOMFORTSCHLIESSUNG_FB).\nDoors/Windows/Mirrors Fold/unfold mirrors with fob - Part 1 (N)FRM SPIEGEL_KOMFORT_EINKLAPP aktiv nicht_aktiv Folds side mirrors with FOB and CA.  Requires that closing windows/moonroof with fob also be enabled (KOMFORTSCHLIESSUNG_FB).\nDoors/Windows/Mirrors Fold/unfold mirrors with fob - Part 2 CAS FH_KOMFORT_MIT_SUBST nicht_aktiv aktiv Folds side mirrors with FOB and CA.  May not be required.  Test Part 1 first.\nDoors/Windows/Mirrors Open/Close liftgate with keyfob and cabin button - Part 1 HKL SCH_FBD nicht_aktiv aktiv Remote liftgate close with key fob and button inside cabin\nDoors/Windows/Mirrors Open/Close liftgate with keyfob and cabin button - Part 2 HKL SCH_TOEHKI nicht_aktiv aktiv Remote liftgate close with key fob and button inside cabin\nDoors/Windows/Mirrors Open/Close liftgate with keyfob and cabin button - Part 3 HKL TASTER_FBD nicht_aktiv aktiv Remote liftgate close with key fob and button inside cabin\nDoors/Windows/Mirrors Rain Close sunroof from full open SHD (FZD) REGENSCHLIESSEN nicht_aktiv aktiv Sunroof Auto wipers have be on for this to work. Once it closes, you wont be able to re-open sunroof until car power down for about 10 minutes.\nDoors/Windows/Mirrors Rain Close Sunroof from Tilt SHD (FZD) REGENSCHLIESSENTILT nicht_aktiv aktiv Sunroof Auto wipers have be on for this to work. Once it closes, you wont be able to re-open sunroof until car power down for about 10 minutes.\nGauge Cluster Auto Headlight Sensitivity from BC Button - Part 1 KOMBI LICHT_AUT_WERT_1 nicht_aktiv aktiv No iDrive Change the sensitivity of your automatic light sensor in your Dash.  For cars without iDrive.\nGauge Cluster Auto Headlight Sensitivity from BC Button - Part 2 KOMBI LICHT_AUT_WERT_2 nicht_aktiv aktiv No iDrive Change the sensitivity of your automatic light sensor in your Dash.  For cars without iDrive.\nGauge Cluster Auto Headlight Sensitivity from BC Button - Part 3 KOMBI LICHT_AUT_WERT_3 nicht_aktiv aktiv No iDrive Change the sensitivity of your automatic light sensor in your Dash.  For cars without iDrive.\nGauge Cluster Digital Speed KOMBI BC_DIGITAL_V nicht_aktiv aktiv Displays digital speed in cluster\nGauge Cluster Digital Speed Adjustment KOMBI BC_DIGITAL_V_KORREKTUR aktiv nicht_aktiv If set to nicht_aktiv, digital speed will give true car speed (not speedometer speed).  If set to aktiv, digital speed will be same as speedometer.\nGauge Cluster Display cruise control set speed KOMBI TEMPOMAT_SETZ_ANZ_DAUER wert_01 wert_02 On vehicles that do not briefly indicate the speed the cruise control is set at, changing this value will enable the display.\nGauge Cluster Enable  Suggestion in 6MT - Part 1 KOMBI SP_ANZEIGE nicht_aktiv aktiv 6MT Enables the EfficientDynamic display for shift suggestions.\nGauge Cluster Enable  Suggestion in 6MT - Part 2 KOMBI SCHALT_PKT_BC nicht_aktiv aktiv 6MT Enables the EfficientDynamic display for shift suggestions.\nGauge Cluster Enable  Suggestion in 6MT - Part 3 KOMBI SCHALT_PKT_DAUERHAFT nicht_aktiv aktiv 6MT Enables the EfficientDynamic display for shift suggestions.   Try nicht_aktiv here if you find you cannot hide the display.\nGauge Cluster Fuel Tank Reserve Warning KOMBI C08_TANK_SCHWELLE_RESERVE wert_04 wert_01 wert_04 = 1/4, wert_01 = 1/8.  Set to wert_02 for slightly higher than 1/8.\nGauge Cluster Instant MPG KOMBI DIGITAL_KVA nicht_aktiv aktiv Displays digital instant-read MPG in cluster\nGauge Cluster Instrument Cluster Lighting Always On KOMBI M_TAG_SKALENBELEUCHTUNG nicht_aktiv aktiv Keeps instrument cluster backlight on all the time, regardless if your headlights are on or not.\niDrive Auto Headlight Sensitivity in iDrive - Part 1 CAPPL RAIN_LIGHT_SENSOR nicht_aktiv aktiv iDrive Change the sensitivity of your automatic light sensor in your Dash.  For CCC cars with iDrive. No current solution for CIC with iDrive.\niDrive Auto Headlight Sensitivity in iDrive - Part 2 CAPPL C750A_SCHWELLWERT_EMPFIN par_gesperrt par_frei iDrive Change the sensitivity of your automatic light sensor in your Dash.  For CCC cars with iDrive. No current solution for CIC with iDrive.\niDrive Auto Headlight Sensitivity in iDrive - Part 3 CAPPL C750A_SCHWELLWERT_NORMAL par_gesperrt par_frei iDrive Change the sensitivity of your automatic light sensor in your Dash.  For CCC cars with iDrive. No current solution for CIC with iDrive.\niDrive Auto Headlight Sensitivity in iDrive - Part 4 CAPPL C750A_SCHWELLWERT_SEHR_E par_gesperrt par_frei iDrive Change the sensitivity of your automatic light sensor in your Dash.  For CCC cars with iDrive. No current solution for CIC with iDrive.\niDrive Disable iDrive Backup Camera Disclaimer CIC MACRO_CAM_LEGAL_DISCLAIMER ld_mit_timeout kein_ld Backup Camera Disables iDrive backup camera disclaimer\niDrive Disable iDrive Camera Disclaimer CIC MACRO_NIVICAM_LDISCLAIMER ld_mit_timeout kein_ld Backup Camera Disables iDrive camera disclaimer\niDrive Disable iDrive Camera Disclaimer RFK WERT_TIME_LD wert_02 wert_00 Backup Camera Disables iDrive camera disclaimer\niDrive Disable iDrive Disclaimer CAPPL LEGAL_DISCL aktiv nicht_aktiv iDrive Disables iDrive legal disclaimer during iDrive startup.\niDrive Disable iDrive Disclaimer CIC LEGAL_DISCLAIMER_TIME ld_mit_timeout kein_ld iDrive Disables iDrive legal disclaimer during iDrive startup. (Note that \"kein_ld\" is a lowercase \"L\", not an uppercase \"I\" (eye) or a \"1\" (one))\niDrive DRL option in iDrive CAPPL DAY_RUN_LIGHT_CCC nicht_aktiv aktiv iDrive Adds a submenu with DRL option (On,Off) in iDrive settings.\niDrive DRL option in iDrive CIC DAYDRIVING_LIGHT perm_off perm_on iDrive Adds a submenu with DRL option (On,Off) in iDrive settings.\niDrive DVD Playback CIC VIDEO_NUR_MIT_HANDBREMSE iDrive Enables DVD playback when car is stopped and parking brake is on.  *Remove DVD from drive before coding\niDrive Enable USB Trip Import CIC NAVI_TRIP_IMPORT nicht_aktiv aktiv Enables the ability to import custom routes from USB\niDrive Fuel Stop Suggestion in Route Guidance CIC NAVI_FUELSTOP_PROPOSAL nicht_aktiv aktiv iDrive Go to \"Route Information\" on iDrive when you're going somewhere and it will tell you at what point(s) along your journey you'll likely need to fill up.\niDrive iDrive Day/Night Display Modes CIC NAVI_MAPMODE_AUTOMATIC nicht_aktiv aktiv iDrive Adds a submenu under Day Mode for Day/Night/Auto.  The menu option becomes availabe but the feature does not work on most cars.\niDrive iDrive Default Screen Communication CAPPL VA_FB_COMMUNICATION iDrive iDrive screen switches to Communication few seconds after startup.\niDrive iDrive Default Screen Entertainment CAPPL VA_FB_ENTERTAINMENT iDrive iDrive screen switches to Entertainment a few seconds after startup.\niDrive iDrive Default Screen Navigation CAPPL VA_FB_NAVIGATION iDrive iDrive screen switches to Navigation a few seconds after startup\niDrive Lock/unlock beep option in iDrive - Part 1 CAPPL ACOUSTIC nicht_aktiv aktiv iDrive Adds a submenu for lock/unlock beep in iDrive Settings.\niDrive Lock/unlock beep option in iDrive - Part 2 CAPPL C941C_QUITT_AKUST_KLAPPE fkt_frei iDrive Adds a submenu for lock/unlock beep in iDrive Settings.\niDrive Lock/unlock beep option in iDrive - Part 3 CAPPL K9416_QUITT_AKUST_ENTSCH fkt_frei iDrive Adds a submenu for lock/unlock beep in iDrive Settings.\niDrive Lock/unlock beep option in iDrive - Part 4 CAPPL C9413_QUITT_AKUST_SCHAERF fkt_frei iDrive Adds a submenu for lock/unlock beep in iDrive Settings.\niDrive Video in Motion (CCC) CAPPL VIDEO_DENY_C0B deny_stop deny_never iDrive Allows video while the car is moving.\niDrive Weather Radio Band CAPPL WEATHERBAND nicht_aktiv aktiv iDrive Adds Weather Band to radio.\niDrive Weather Radio Band CIC RADIO_WEATHERBAND nicht_aktiv aktiv iDrive Adds Weather Band to radio.\nLighting - Angel Eyes Angel Eyes - Error Part 1 (N)FRM FEHLERMELDUNG_CC_SL_V_L aktiv nicht_aktiv Removes/disables angel eye / parking light errors\nLighting - Angel Eyes Angel Eyes - Error Part 2 (N)FRM FEHLERMELDUNG_CC_SL_V_R aktiv nicht_aktiv Removes/disables angel eye / parking light errors\nLighting - Angel Eyes Angel Eyes - Error Part 3 (N)FRM KALTUEBERWACHUNG_SL_V_L Removes/disables angel eye / parking light errors\nLighting - Angel Eyes Angel Eyes - Error Part 4 (N)FRM KALTUEBERWACHUNG_SL_V_R Removes/disables angel eye / parking light errors\nLighting - Angel Eyes Angel Eyes - Error Part 5 (N)FRM WARMUEBERWACHUNG_SL_V_L Removes/disables angel eye / parking light errors\nLighting - Angel Eyes Angel Eyes - Error Part 6 (N)FRM WARMUEBERWACHUNG_SL_V_R Removes/disables angel eye / parking light errors\nLighting - Angel Eyes Angel Eyes - on with Daytime Lights Part 1 (N)FRM DRL_TFL_MIT_SML(_3R) nicht_aktiv aktiv Use Angel Eyes for DRL.  Must have TAGFAHRLICHT_ECE_1 set to \"aktiv\".\nLighting - Angel Eyes Angel Eyes - on with Daytime Lights Part 2 (N)FRM VERHALTEN_DRL_TFL(_3R) drl_tfl_off drl_s Use Angel Eyes for DRL.  Must have TAGFAHRLICHT_ECE_1 set to \"aktiv\".\nLighting - Angel Eyes Angel Eyes - on with Welcome Lights (N)FRM WL_SL_1 See Description See Description Angel Eyes on. Aktiv Values: \"hart_einschalten\" - instant on; \"soft_einschalten\" - gradual; \"nicht_aktiv\" - disabled.\nLighting - Brake Force Light Brake Force Light - on with regular brake light (N)FRM BREMSL_FKT_MIT_BFD nicht_aktiv aktiv Enables both brake lights (Standard Brakelight with Brake Force Light)\nLighting - Brake Force Light Brake Force Light - on with Welcome Lights (N)FRM WL_BFD See Description See Description Brake force light on. Aktiv Values: \"hart_einschalten\" - instant on; \"soft_einschalten\" - gradual; \"nicht_aktiv\" - disabled.\nLighting - Corner LED Corner LED - off with DRL (N)FRM TAGFAHRLICHT_ECE_0 aktiv nicht_aktiv Disables corner LED when DRL are on.\nLighting - Corner LED Corner LED - off with Headlights (N)FRM PWM_FL_ALS_CORNERLIGHT wert_01 wert_02 Disables corner LED light when headlights are on.\nLighting - Corner LED Corner LED - off with Headlights (N)FRM SL_BL_ERS_DEF_RL_BL_1 aktiv nicht_aktiv Disables corner LED light when headlights are on.\nLighting - Corner LED Corner LED - off with High Beams (N)FRM PWM_POL_BEI_AKTIVEN_AL wert_03 wert_04 Disables corner LED light with high beams.\nLighting - Corner LED Corner LED - off with High Beams (N)FRM PWM_SL_V_BEI_AKTIVEN_AL wert_03 wert_04 Disables corner LED light with high beams\nLighting - Corner LED Corner LED - off with Low Beams (N)FRM PWM_POL_BEI_AKTIVEN_FL wert_03 wert_04 Disables corner LED light with low beams.\nLighting - Corner LED Corner LED - off with Low Beams (N)FRM PWM_SL_V_BEI_AKTIVEN_FL wert_03 wert_04 Disables corner LED light with low beams.\nLighting - Corner LED Corner LED - off with Parking Lights (N)FRM PO_RL_FKT_MIT_SL_V aktiv nicht_aktiv Disables corner LED light when parkinglights are on.\nLighting - Corner LED Corner LED - off with Parking Lights (N)FRM SL_FKT_MIT_POL aktiv nic